              text: "- **Aesthetic Direction**: Playful Developer Console + Subtle Glassmorphism based on the Stitch UI specification (`#0F131D` dark slate void, electric blue `#3B82F6`, emerald green `#10B981`, radiant amber `#F59E0B`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Typography**: Comic Relief for friendly headlines, Comic Neue for technical labels and timestamps."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Views & Flows**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. **City & Event Selector**: Switch between Bengaluru and Gurugram upcoming sessions (Morning 9 AM - 1 PM, Evening 2 PM - 6 PM)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. **RSVP Card**: Binary YES / NO decision. Clicking YES unlocks origin area selector, transit stop picker, and boarding time chips. Clicking NO shows a polite acknowledgment with a modify link."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  3. **Live Community Headcount & Huddle Manifest**: Shows active builders boarding from the selected hub, member initials avatars, and last-mile cab split recommendations."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  4. **Arrival & Huddle Coordination Board**: New interactive section enabling attendees to click \"I Have Arrived\" at the meetup landmark and view who else is currently waiting to walk/ride in together."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Node.js / Express Full-Stack Backend**: Uses Express backend in `server.ts` to host REST API endpoints with in-memory SQLite/JSON persistence so multi-user RSVP summaries and \"I have arrived\" check-ins work in real-time across browser sessions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Scraper Fallback**: Built-in scraper simulation with rich pre-seeded data for Bengaluru and Gurugram transit hubs ensuring 100% reliability in the AI Studio preview environment."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
