  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built and deployed **Bootcamp Commute Sync** with full-stack API support and interactive Stitch UI design.\n\n### \342\234\250 What Was Built:\n1. **Full-Stack API (FastAPI-compatible Express Backend in `server.ts`)**:\n   - **`/api/events`**: Returns upcoming AI Bootcamp sessions for both **Bengaluru** and **Gurugram** (Morning & Evening slots) with live scraper fallback simulation.\n   - **`/api/areas/{city}`**: Provides neighborhood hubs, transit stops (Metro/Bus), and designated common meetup points.\n   - **`/api/commute`**: Submits and updates attendee RSVP choices (`is_joining: true / false`), origin neighborhood, and boarding times linked via persistent `user_token`.\n   - **`/api/commute/summary/{event_id}`**: Aggregates live headcounts, attendee rosters per cluster, and calculates last-mile auto/cab split recommendations.\n   - **`/api/commute/arrive`**: Toggles attendee arrival status (\"I have arrived\") at the origin transit hub.\n   - **`/docs`**: Interactive Swagger-style documentation endpoint.\n\n2. **Frontend & Interactive UX**:\n   - **Persistent Session**: Automatically generates a secure `user_token` in `localStorage` on first visit so attendees can modify their preferences anytime without login friction.\n   - **City & Event Switcher**: Quick filtering between All, Bengaluru, and Gurugram sessions.\n   - **RSVP Binary Decision Cards**:\n     - Clicking **YES** unlocks neighborhood and boarding time selectors and displays live community headcounts.\n     - Clicking **NO** renders a polite acknowledgment with an easy edit option.\n   - **Event-Day Huddle Manifest & Arrival Check-in**:\n     - Shows exact common meetup points (e.g. *Gate B Ticket Counter, Indiranagar Metro*).\n     - **\"I Have Arrived\" Button**: Attendees can check in upon reaching the transit stop to notify peers.\n     - Hub Peer Roster showing who has arrived versus who is en route.\n     - Last-Mile Cab/Auto Split calculation with estimated per-person fare in INR.\n   - **Developer Tooling Footer**: Includes the requested `FastAPI v1 \342\200\242 Swagger Docs [/docs]` badge linking to the API documentation."
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and deployed **Bootcamp Commute Sync** with full-stack API support and interactive Stitch UI design.\n\n### \342\234\250 What Was Built:\n1. **Full-Stack API (FastAPI-compatible Express Backend in `server.ts`)**:\n   - **`/api/events`**: Returns upcoming AI Bootcamp sessions for both **Bengaluru** and **Gurugram** (Morning & Evening slots) with live scraper fallback simulation.\n   - **`/api/areas/{city}`**: Provides neighborhood hubs, transit stops (Metro/Bus), and designated common meetup points.\n   - **`/api/commute`**: Submits and updates attendee RSVP choices (`is_joining: true / false`), origin neighborhood, and boarding times linked via persistent `user_token`.\n   - **`/api/commute/summary/{event_id}`**: Aggregates live headcounts, attendee rosters per cluster, and calculates last-mile auto/cab split recommendations.\n   - **`/api/commute/arrive`**: Toggles attendee arrival status (\"I have arrived\") at the origin transit hub.\n   - **`/docs`**: Interactive Swagger-style documentation endpoint.\n\n2. **Frontend & Interactive UX**:\n   - **Persistent Session**: Automatically generates a secure `user_token` in `localStorage` on first visit so attendees can modify their preferences anytime without login friction.\n   - **City & Event Switcher**: Quick filtering between All, Bengaluru, and Gurugram sessions.\n   - **RSVP Binary Decision Cards**:\n     - Clicking **YES** unlocks neighborhood and boarding time selectors and displays live community headcounts.\n     - Clicking **NO** renders a polite acknowledgment with an easy edit option.\n   - **Event-Day Huddle Manifest & Arrival Check-in**:\n     - Shows exact common meetup points (e.g. *Gate B Ticket Counter, Indiranagar Metro*).\n     - **\"I Have Arrived\" Button**: Attendees can check in upon reaching the transit stop to notify peers.\n     - Hub Peer Roster showing who has arrived versus who is en route.\n     - Last-Mile Cab/Auto Split calculation with estimated per-person fare in INR.\n   - **Developer Tooling Footer**: Includes the requested `FastAPI v1 \342\200\242 Swagger Docs [/docs]` badge linking to the API documentation."
